<div class="content-section">
    <h1>About</h1>

   

    <p>**Who's behind Victory Sparkle Co.**</p>

<p>Hi, I'm Ryen — part-time glitter alchemist, full-time tinkerer. Victory Sparkle Co. started as a place to stash my craft projects and has since sprouted a small colony of browser tools and coding experiments that refused to stay contained.</p>

<p>I make things I wish already existed: stained glass patterns that don't require a design degree, seamless tiles that actually tile, pins that print the way you imagined them. All of the tools are free to use right now, no installs, no accounts, no catch.</p>

<p>Lately I've been deep in a mix of craft-making and code-wrangling (a few Telegram bots included), chasing whatever idea is loudest that week. If you make things too, or you're stuck on a project and want to compare notes, I'd love to hear from you. </p>

<p>Want to get in touch? The [contact page](https://victorysparkle.com/contact/) has every way to reach me, and [events](https://victorysparkle.com/events/) lists where I'll be in person.</p>

